==Strategy==
Even though there's not really much going on in these set of ten stages, Super Hyppoh is still a menace of a pusher, so don't get too relaxed.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver BearCat]]: Removes Zoges before they can interfere too much.
*[[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cat]]: Your main saving grace to prevent Super Hyppoh from doing too much. The generous startoff means you can freely stack two Cyberpunks to just wall Hyppoh forever after you hit the base.
*[[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat)|Awakened Mina]]: Good non-Uber sniper to deal with Camelle.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*Snipers in general are valuable to try and remove Camelle quickly. [[Sea Serpent Daliasan (Uber Rare Cat)|Sea King Daliasan]], [[Radiant Aphrodite (Uber Rare Cat)|Megaphrodite]], [[Child of Destiny Phono (Uber Rare Cat)|King of Destiny Phonoa]], and [[King of Doom Phono (Uber Rare Cat)|King of Extinction Phono]] are good units to use here.

